  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/07/IMG_6818.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Anna Pe&ntilde;a Ma&ntilde;ana (amb bata roja/rosa) ser&aacute; la reina de la Fira d&#39;Onda 2018, despr&eacute;s del sorteig que s&#39;ha fet la vesprada d&#39;aquest dilluns durant el ple extraordinari de l&#39;Ajuntament. Marian Moya Mart&iacute;, de La Chicuelina, i Sonia Rodr&iacute;guez Berzosa, de la nova associaci&oacute; cultural taurina Les 300 Torres, seran les dames de la Cort d&#39;honor.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinafiraonda18/img_6734.jpg\" alt=\"img_6734\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinafiraonda18/img_6735.jpg\" alt=\"img_6735\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinafiraonda18/img_6737.jpg\" alt=\"img_6737\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinafiraonda18/img_6739.jpg\" alt=\"img_6739\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinafiraonda18/img_6740.jpg\" alt=\"img_6740\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinafiraonda18/img_6741.jpg\" alt=\"img_6741\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinafiraonda18/img_6743.jpg\" alt=\"img_6743\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinafiraonda18/img_6745.jpg\" alt=\"img_6745\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigrein